Rule of project


1. Do not use !! as null check
2. Do not give names like tv_, img...
3. Do not repeat code.code







Kotlin features used :--

1. Stateflow
2. difference between var , val , cont val



Retrofit Annotation:--

1. @Query("emp_code") // Get APi in Form data
2. @QueryMap()  // GET
3. @Field()   // POst api single type
4. @Body  //  object
5. @Part     // Media
6. @PartMap

1.R8 Shinking-property for reduce the apk size in release mode


